{{ section }} ODE system

{% set rules = odes | selectattr("origin", "equalto", "rate_rule") | list %}
The states change in time with {{ "the rates of the reactions and the rate rules" if rules and rules | length < odes | length else ("the rate rules" if rules else "the rates of the reactions") }}:

{{ equations(odes) -}}
