{% endif %}
{% if e.priority is not none %}
- Priority: ${{ e.priority }}$
{% endif %}
- `initialValue` {{ e.initial_value | lower }}, `persistent` {{ e.persistent | lower }}, `useValuesFromTriggerTime` {{ e.use_trigger_values | lower }}
{% if e.assignments %}

$ {% for a in e.assignments %}{{ a.lhs }} &colon.eq {{ a.rhs }}{{ " \\\n  " if not loop.last }}{% endfor %} $
{% for a in e.assignments if a.conversion %}

{% if a.conversion == "amount" %}
${{ a.lhs }}$ is the amount of ${{ a.species }}$, the assigned concentration times the size of ${{ a.compartment }}$ at the execution of the event.
{% else %}
${{ a.lhs }}$ is converted from the size of ${{ a.compartment }}$ at the execution of the event to the size ${{ a.new }}$ the event assigns, so that its amount is kept.
